# Local run (IntelliJ / mvnw) listens on 8022; with Docker Compose use 8080 (or APP_PORT)

### Latest rates for EUR
GET http://localhost:8022/api/v1/rates/latest?base=EUR

### Latest rates, only some currencies
GET http://localhost:8022/api/v1/rates/latest?base=USD&symbols=EUR,GBP,JPY
X-API-Key: demo-client

### Historical rates (weekends return the previous business day)
GET http://localhost:8022/api/v1/rates/2020-03-16?base=EUR&symbols=USD

### Convert with the latest rates
GET http://localhost:8022/api/v1/convert?from=EUR&to=USD&amount=1250.75

### Convert with the rates of a given date
GET http://localhost:8022/api/v1/convert?from=GBP&to=JPY&amount=99.99&date=2024-01-02

### Unsupported currency -> 400 problem detail
GET http://localhost:8022/api/v1/rates/latest?base=ABC

### Health, including the circuit breaker state
GET http://localhost:8022/actuator/health

### Prometheus metrics
GET http://localhost:8022/actuator/prometheus
